Great!

Also good to know is that there is an active branch (https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/tree/wip-build-refactor) in which Alex is cleaning up the GNU R package plugin for Maven. There are a few cases which will still cause a problem with the POM you are using so he's cleaning that up. We'll announce the availability of the new plugin here or in our monthly newsletter (sign up via http://www.renjin.org).

Regards,

Maarten-Jan

